ker-controlled sites. These links direct victims to credential-harvesting pages or malware-staging infrastructure prepared during the group's resource-development phase. Interaction with the links lets ShadowSilk capture credentials or deliver payloads while bypassing some attachment-based defenses."], ["confidence", null], ["execution_start", null], ["execution_end", null]], "anchors": {"0": "6369e400-9d2f-4be8-ba97-d3f6fc21e4dd", "30": "b9d1c346-b3e1-44bc-97f7-4acff8b95d16", "60": "af47248c-c952-4e77-a8d6-5bee406518f3", "90": "cb7c2aba-f2ec-41ad-97db-be2619ceacf6", "120": "a80ea9a3-91db-4bf6-a90e-7806f4b711ad", "150": "96972026-7e2a-4a83-8c78-420632579256", "180": "dfc2edaa-b761-4dcc-a1a5-05280d50dee6", "210": "9cafbd24-140b-4062-ab73-24894a704290", "240": "75005327-5f22-44f3-a7f8-935e62929cda", "270": "2ba7bfe2-56fc-4a2e-a7cd-f0d601b77325", "300": "96001615-ab2e-4059-8e69-3935bbd316c2", "330": "cd0a3d2f-1394-4ff0-88dc-015dc2e56096"}}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "20461868-246b-4d7a-a1a7-d2734d1912a3", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "5e61b449-c9bd-475e-9fdc-bd439329807c", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "5f370b60-c27c-4588-b71d-d78b5dfd20a1", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "47df3aad-e55e-4df4-a01a-a354b65c1fc6", "latches": ["c7aed053-929a-4cce-a0bc-51f12b19fdc8"]}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "31dc3544-c118-4240-930e-bbeda9f8cd93", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "08a026e5-1469-423c-9073-fa2f9045916e", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "a7fa087d-ff7a-4293-bb60-7ce50ffccad1", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "9bff67b4-f869-4d3f-a9fa-d762555efd5c", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "0f04fe7a-935c-4bc6-9018-e439e94ab241", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "c22db3fb-4a02-4a09-8e21-6f48c0245def", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "de26c8a1-29eb-4d3b-b964-954d829ffba2", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "ee6ac2cf-61c7-4c44-9814-3d2e6d70f9f6", "latches": []}, {"id": "action", "instance": "4eb67380-f218-4220-ae5b-87cef1e89262", "properties": [["name", "Valid Accounts"], ["ttp", [["tactic", "TA0001"], ["technique", "T1078"]]], ["description", "ShadowSilk makes use of valid credentials obtained through phishing and credential theft to authenticate to victim systems and services. By operating with legitimate accounts, the group blends in with normal user activity, evades detection, and maintains durable access for lateral movement, discovery, and data collection across compromised environments."], ["confidence", null], ["execution_start", null], ["execution_end", null]], "anchors": {"0": "20461868-246b-4d7a-a1a7-d2734d1912a3", "30": "5e61b449-c9bd-475e-9fdc-bd439329807c", "60": "5f370b60-c27c-4588-b71d-d78b5dfd20a1", "90": "47df3aad-e55e-4df4-a01a-a354b65c1fc6", "120": "31dc3544-c118-4240-930e-bbeda9f8cd93", "150": "08a026e5-1469-423c-9073-fa2f9045916e", "180": "a7fa087d-ff7a-4293-bb60-7ce50ffccad1", "210": "9bff67b4-f869-4d3f-a9fa-d762555efd5c", "240": "0f04fe7a-935c-4bc6-9018-e439e94ab241", "270": "c22db3fb-4a02-4a09-8e21-6f48c0245def", "300": "de26c8a1-29eb-4d3b-b964-954d829ffba2", "330": "ee6ac2cf-61c7-4c44-9814-3d2e6d70f9f6"}}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "6668168e-aa94-41f0-824a-66f83ea71ad9", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "fc0c829a-343f-4464-867d-e92c68ba3d5b", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "900aa5bf-585a-463b-9809-0042d75767b3", "latches": []}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "36444bb7-b532-4c50-84b2-d7be09fba7a6", "latches": ["c1ee4ef9-b860-4c89-83b8-976b2093c58a"]}, {"id": "vertical_anchor", "instance": "f4bd26ef-a804-4854-9a8e-e7ee24a45e84", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "b9290fbd-ab1a-402c-a177-b0aad0831917", "latches": []}, {"id": "horizontal_anchor", "instance": "c8c0ac9c-4896-4e41-a2f1-97aa